# Oracle: VD cir-hier (Scope: own subcircuit, then the top; then variables, constants);
# DIALECT-VACASK Appendix A runs n1 (an enclosing subcircuit's parameter: "Variable or constant
# 'p' not defined"), n5 (a forward reference is legal). The read of `p` in `inner` stays unbound
# and is refused (R2003).
# codes: R2003
file "scope.sim" deck
  title "binding"
  param top = 1i
  param early = late * 2i
  param late = 3i
  subckt outer (a) p=7i
    param own = p + top
    subckt inner (b)
      param k = p? + top
